#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Introduction to primitives in Qiskit Runtime, and an explanation of "
"available primitives"
msgstr ""
"Introduzione alle primitive in Qiskit Runtime e spiegazione delle primitive "
"disponibili"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to primitives"
msgstr "Introduzione alle primitive"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to primitives {#introduction-to-primitives}"
msgstr "Introduzione alle primitive {#introduction-to-primitives}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Primitives were created to simplify the most common tasks for quantum "
"computers: namely, sampling quantum states and calculating expectation "
"values. The first Qiskit Runtime primitives "
"([`EstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/estimator-v2) and "
"[`SamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/sampler-v2)) are implementations of the Qiskit [primitives base "
"classes](/guides/primitives). They provide a more sophisticated "
"implementation (for example, by including error mitigation) as a cloud-based"
" service and are used to access IBM Quantum&reg; hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Le primitive sono state create per semplificare le attività più comuni dei "
"computer quantistici: campionare stati quantistici e calcolare i valori di "
"aspettazione. Le prime primitive di Qiskit Runtime "
"([`EstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/estimator-v2) e "
"[`SamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/sampler-v2)) sono implementazioni delle [classi base delle "
"primitive](/guides/primitives) di Qiskit. Forniscono un'implementazione più "
"sofisticata (ad esempio, includendo la mitigazione degli errori) come "
"servizio cloud e vengono utilizzate per accedere all'hardware IBM "
"Quantum&reg;.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The newest Qiskit Runtime primitive, "
"[Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor) "
"(which is in beta), provides a lower-level interface that gives more "
"visibility and control without sacrificing performance.\n"
msgstr ""
"La più recente primitiva di Qiskit Runtime, "
"[Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor) (in"
" beta), fornisce un'interfaccia di livello inferiore che offre maggiore "
"visibilità e controllo senza sacrificare le prestazioni.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Estimator\"\n"
"      description=\"Computes the expectation values for one or more observables with respect to states prepared by quantum circuits.  Has built-in error suppression and mitigation methods.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-estimator\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Estimator\"\n"
"      description=\"Calcola i valori di aspettazione per uno o più osservabili rispetto agli stati preparati dai Circuit quantistici. Dispone di metodi integrati di soppressione e mitigazione degli errori.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-estimator\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Avvio rapido con Estimator\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sampler\"\n"
"      description=\"Samples the output register from the execution of one or more quantum circuits.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-sampler\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sampler\"\n"
"      description=\"Campiona il registro di output dall'esecuzione di uno o più Circuit quantistici.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-sampler\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Avvio rapido con Sampler\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <Card\n"
"      title=\"Executor (beta)\"\n"
"      description=\"Samples output registers from quantum circuit executions based on input directives and gives you full control and transparency over customizing error mitigation methods.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-executor\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"        <Card\n"
"      title=\"Executor (beta)\"\n"
"      description=\"Campiona i registri di output dalle esecuzioni di Circuit quantistici in base a direttive di input e ti offre pieno controllo e trasparenza nella personalizzazione dei metodi di mitigazione degli errori.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-executor\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Avvio rapido con Executor\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Passi successivi {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Learn about the [Qiskit primitives](/guides/primitives) that the Qiskit Runtime primitives are based on.\n"
"- Review detailed [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples), [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples), or [Executor](/guides/executor-examples) examples.\n"
"- See the input and output details for [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output), [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output), and [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- See the [EstimatorV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2), [SamplerV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2), and [Executor API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor).\n"
"- Read [Migrate to V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Raccomandazioni\">\n"
"- Scopri le [primitive Qiskit](/guides/primitives) su cui si basano le primitive di Qiskit Runtime.\n"
"- Consulta esempi dettagliati di [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples), [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples) o [Executor](/guides/executor-examples).\n"
"- Consulta i dettagli di input e output per [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output), [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output) e [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output).\n"
"- Fai pratica con le primitive seguendo la [lezione sulle funzioni di costo](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Consulta il [riferimento API EstimatorV2](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2), il [riferimento API SamplerV2](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2) e il [riferimento API Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor).\n"
"- Leggi [Migra alle primitive V2](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
